n_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k\">\\(I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))\">\\(u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))\">\\(v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))\\)</span>，与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" href=\"?note=ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" title=\"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions\">73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions</a> 相同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*,\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(*,\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*\\ne\\$\">\\(*\\ne\\$\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma&#39;=\\Sigma\\cup\\{*,\\$\\}\">\\(\\Sigma&#39;=\\Sigma\\cup\\{*,\\$\\}\\)</span>；两个新字符在全部子句中固定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\rho:\\Sigma^*\\to(\\Sigma&#39;)^*\">\\(\\lambda,\\rho:\\Sigma^*\\to(\\Sigma&#39;)^*\\)</span> 由下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(I)\\in((\\Sigma&#39;)^+\\times(\\Sigma&#39;)^+)^{k+2}\">\\(J(I)\\in((\\Sigma&#39;)^+\\times(\\Sigma&#39;)^+)^{k+2}\\)</span> 是所定义的新实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(w)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|w|-1}\\langle *,w(j)\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\rho(w)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|w|-1}\\langle w(j),*\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(w)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|w|-1}\\langle *,w(j)\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\rho(w)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|w|-1}\\langle w(j),*\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J(I)\\coloneqq\n\\langle(\\langle *\\rangle\\rho(u_0),\\lambda(v_0))\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle(\\rho(u_i),\\lambda(v_i)):0\\le i&lt;k\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle(\\langle \\$\\rangle,\\langle *,\\$\\rangle)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J(I)\\coloneqq\n\\langle(\\langle *\\rangle\\rho(u_0),\\lambda(v_0))\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle(\\rho(u_i),\\lambda(v_i)):0\\le i&lt;k\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle(\\langle \\$\\rangle,\\langle *,\\$\\rangle)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>首块在两行都以星号开始，普通块的上下行起始类型错位，结束块用结束字符对齐剩余星号。所有新块的两行仍非空，满足所选 PCP 版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions","status":"resolved","id":"ef2510d5b7c48e0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions","status":"resolved","id":"ef2510d5b7c48e0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k$；对 $i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}$，$u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))$、$v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))$，与 [[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]] 相同。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))","display":false},{"tex":"v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))","display":false},{"tex":"*,\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}","display":false},{"tex":"*\\ne\\$","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma'=\\Sigma\\cup\\{*,\\$\\}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda,\\rho:\\Sigma^*\\to(\\Sigma')^*","display":false},{"tex":"J(I)\\in((\\Sigma')^+\\times(\\Sigma')^+)^{k+2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(w)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|w|-1}\\langle *,w(j)\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\rho(w)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|w|-1}\\langle w(j),*\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"J(I)\\coloneqq\n\\langle(\\langle *\\rangle\\rho(u_0),\\lambda(v_0))\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle(\\rho(u_i),\\lambda(v_i)):0\\le i<k\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle(\\langle \\$\\rangle,\\langle *,\\$\\rangle)\\rangle.","display":true}],"bytes":1859,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-mpcp-to-pcp-construction|星号错位构造：MPCP 到 PCP]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"8588726b1564520d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I,J(I),\\Sigma,\\Sigma'$ 采用 [[73-df-mpcp-to-pcp-construction]]。"}],"outgoing":["ef2510d5b7c48e0c"]}